{"id": "68889", "title": "大嫁光临", "author": "赵家小今", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 25, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68889.htm", "intro": "相个亲也能遇见妖精打架，她是交了哪辈子的狗屎运哦！哎哟喂，等等，男妖精啊，你可不可以不要缠着人家？捣乱人家的相亲大会，后果很严重哦！她发出了严重警告，他居然还不听？依然固我是吧，哼，既然如此，害她丢了一个结婚对象，就把他自己赔给她吧！\r\n\r\n（轻松搞笑YY文）", "base": "files/article/html/68/68889", "chapters": [{"title": "第一章：相亲遇见鬼", "file": "10550522.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章：隔山打牛的小电影", "file": "10550523.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章：桌下风光再好，不是久留之地", "file": "10550524.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章：叔，不是白马王爷", "file": "10550525.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章：城门那个失火，殃及池鱼", "file": "10550526.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章：大叔的杀器", "file": "10550527.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章：剩菜的问题", "file": "10550528.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章：老许家的败家女", "file": "10550529.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章：桃花岛许小主", "file": "10550530.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章：暴躁的大妈", "file": "10550531.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章：狩猎一个老公", "file": "10550532.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章：“黑”你没商量", "file": "10550533.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章：六部之首", "file": "10550534.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章：战斗剩佛再会三藏法师", "file": "10550535.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章：哥是一个传说", "file": "10550536.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章：佛爷茹荤不茹素", "file": "10550537.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章：绝情坑主", "file": "10550538.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八章：绝情坑主【下】", "file": "10550539.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九章：一个十分邪恶的念头……", "file": "10550540.html", "available": false}, {"title": "20-24", "file": "10550541.html", "available": false}, {"title": "25-29", "file": "10550542.html", "available": false}, {"title": "30-34", "file": "10550543.html", "available": false}, {"title": "35-38", "file": "10550544.html", "available": false}, {"titl